{"id":"A1-L085","title":"Prepositions of time: production and review","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U06","focus":"Prepositions of time — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Prepositions of time — produção e revisão","pron":"think/this","verbs":["take"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["bloom","spring flowers","morning dew","cherry blossom","gentle breeze","quiet pond","falling leaves","first frost","winter moon","summer rain","autumn wind","sunset glow","haiku","seasonal"],"field":"Lazer","genre":"Poema, haiku ou letra","skill":"Fala","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 85 · Prepositions of time: production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Prepositions of time — produção e revisão.","**Verbos:** take.","**Pronúncia:** think/this.","**14 palavras novas** (lazer).","**Texto do dia:** poema, haiku ou letra."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo escrever um poema com tempo e usar take."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["bloom","florescer"],["spring flowers","spring flowers"],["morning dew","morning dew"],["cherry blossom","cherry blossom"],["gentle breeze","gentle breeze"],["quiet pond","quiet pond"],["falling leaves","falling leaves"],["first frost","first frost"],["winter moon","winter moon"],["summer rain","summer rain"],["autumn wind","autumn wind"],["sunset glow","sunset glow"],["haiku","haiku"],["seasonal","seasonal"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A haiku","blocks":[{"type":"poem","title":"Days","lines":["On Monday, I run.","In May, flowers take the sun.","At night, I rest."],"by":"Original haiku for learners","gloss":[["flower","flor"],["rest","descansar"],["sun","sol"],["run","correr"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The speaker runs on Monday.","ans":"T","why":"“On Monday, I run.”"},{"q":"Flowers appear in winter.","ans":"F","why":"May."},{"q":"The speaker rests at night.","ans":"T","why":"“At night, I rest.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“flower” means…","opts":["flor","folha","árvore"],"ans":0,"why":"flower."},{"q":"“rest” means…","opts":["descansar","correr","comer"],"ans":0,"why":"rest."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Time: review","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pergunta","Resposta"],"rows":[["**What time…?**","**at six**"],["**What day…?**","**on Monday**"],["**When…?**","**in May / in 2026**"],["**How long…?**","**for two hours**"]],"cap":"Time: review"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Sem preposição com *every, next, last, this*: *next Monday* (não *on next Monday*)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I run ___ Monday. (on)","a":"on","why":"dia."},{"s":"Flowers bloom ___ May. (in)","a":"in","why":"mês."},{"s":"I rest ___ night. (at)","a":"at","why":"at night."},{"s":"Let’s ___ a walk. (take)","a":"take","why":"take a walk."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["flower","flor"],["bloom","florescer"],["night","noite"],["walk","caminhada"],["spring","primavera"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["the","morning","In"],"ans":"In the morning","pt":"De manhã."},{"words":["take","a","walk","When","do","you"],"ans":"When do you take a walk","pt":"Quando você caminha?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"bloom","pos":"word","pt":"florescer","ex":"Flowers bloom.","expt":"As fl